#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is coveted.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王人人羡慕。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:311
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_JustinIntro"
msgid "I keep coming back to this same place!$"
msgstr "我老是回到同一个地方！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_JustinDefeat"
msgid ""
"I'm already having trouble, and then\n"
"you have to beat me? It's not fair!$"
msgstr ""
"我已经够头疼了，\n"
"你还要打败我？太不公平了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:318
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_JustinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's full of doors here!\n"
"It's too small and dark in here! Help!$"
msgstr "这里到处都是门！又窄又暗！救命啊！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:322
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_MarthaIntro"
msgid ""
"I don't know what's going on here.\n"
"I'm starting to feel sad…$"
msgstr ""
"我搞不懂这里是怎么回事。\n"
"开始觉得难过了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_MarthaDefeat"
msgid "You… You're awful!$"
msgstr "你……你太过分了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:329
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_MarthaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I know I'm weak!\n"
"And, I have no sense of direction!$"
msgstr "我知道我很弱！而且，我还是个路痴！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:333
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_AlanIntro"
msgid ""
"I don't get it. What would anyone want\n"
"with a house this bizarre?$"
msgstr ""
"我真搞不懂。\n"
"谁会想要这么奇怪的房子啊？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:337
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_AlanDefeat"
msgid ""
"I don't get it.\n"
"How did I lose?$"
msgstr "我真搞不懂。我怎么会输呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3/scripts.inc:341
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle3_Text_AlanPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I don't get it.\n"
"How many traps are in this house?\p"
"You may be the one to solve that.$"
msgstr ""
"我真搞不懂。\n"
"这间房子里到底有多少个陷阱？\p"
"说不定你能解开这个谜。$"
